{
  "_": "How to watch a network from Chicago, for the live game block (app.js renderTeamLive). Keys are regexes matched against ESPN's broadcast names, case-insensitive; first match wins. DirecTV and Dish numbers are the national ones, except the Chicago locals (WBBM 2, WMAQ 5, WLS 7, WGN 9, WCIU 26, WFLD 32, WCPX 38) and CHSN 665 / Marquee 664, read from tvtv.us's DIRECTV Chicago and DISH Chicago lineups (2026-10-31); xfinity = the 'Xfinity Chicago Areas 1, 4, & 5' lineup (tvtv.us lineup USA-IL54437-X, ZIP 60601, read 2026-10-31 in a browser by the method in lqa's scripts/xfinity-lineup.mjs — the basic number per call sign; this repo has no copy of that script, so the numbers were entered by hand; CHSN 200 and Marquee 202 also match their carriage-deal announcements); ota = the Chicago over-the-air station and channel (tvtv.us 'Local over the air', 60601); stream = the services that carry it. A streaming-only service lists just its name; apps = device → the page to install its app from.",
  "_bars": "bars = the commercial service a venue subscribes to for it: EverPass carries the streaming-only games (Sunday Ticket, the Peacock, Netflix and Prime games, Apple's MLS) to bars and restaurants; it does not carry cable networks like BTN. DAZN agreed to buy it in August 2026. app.js buildStreamList prints it as \"bars: EverPass\" after the ways.",
